{"availability":"available","full":"VictorZakharov/dark-strands","name":"dark-strands","description":"Real-time 3D rendering & engine tech demo in Babylon.js 9 (WebGPU/WebGL2) — procedural village, forests, weather, Gerstner-wave water, volumetric fog & Havok physics.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":3,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-15T01:53:33Z","updated":"2026-07-18T20:41:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://darkst.netlify.app/","topics":["3d-graphics","babylonjs","ez-tree","havok","javascript","procedural-generation","realtime-rendering","shaders","tech-demo","threejs","webgl2","webgpu"],"demo":"https://darkst.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.994Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.994Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.994Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:46:14.994Z","stars":3,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real-time 3D rendering & engine tech demo built with Babylon.js 9 (WebGPU, with automatic WebGL2 fallback).","▶ Live demo — · desktop Chrome/Edge recommended for WebGPU; click to enter, WASD to move.","Dark Strands is an interactive technical showcase — not a game you win. There are no objectives, score, or end state; it's a walkable sandbox built to exercise a from-scratch graphics and simulation stack: a procedurally generated village of stone buildings and dirt roads, rolling terrain, wind-swept ez-tree forests, a Gerstner-wave ocean with planar reflections, volumetric height fog with god rays, a day/night cycle, a weather state machine, clustered torch lighting, Havok physics, and ambient audio. Explore it in first or third person, on desktop or mobile."],"features":["Procedural village — A main dirt road with branches winds past the spawn; stone buildings (1- and 2-story) line the roads with their doors facing them; standing torches light the roadsides at night","Procedural buildings — Doorways, glass windows of varied shapes/sizes, flat/gable roofs, climbable stairs, 2nd floors, beds (sleep to morning)","Terrain — Gentle rolling hills with automatic flat zones under buildings; roads conform to the terrain","Ocean & lakes — Gerstner wave animated water with planar reflections, shoreline foam, rain ripples, Fresnel/specular/subsurface shading","Forests — Procedurally generated trees via ez-tree: oak/ash/aspen deciduous trees, pine groves, bush thickets — real branching geometry with alpha-tested leaf textures, thin-instanced (2 draw calls per species variant).…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VictorZakharov/dark-strands/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2e95d4161f47530a9880b1b9132593d4620f36a8fe907af26dabe32e8380a4cf","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:15.176Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:15.176Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real-time 3D rendering & engine tech demo built with Babylon.js 9 (WebGPU, with automatic WebGL2 fallback).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VictorZakharov/dark-strands/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"2e95d4161f47530a9880b1b9132593d4620f36a8fe907af26dabe32e8380a4cf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VictorZakharov/dark-strands/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:15.177Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-18T20:41:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VictorZakharov/dark-strands/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:46:15.179Z","hash":"2e95d4161f47530a9880b1b9132593d4620f36a8fe907af26dabe32e8380a4cf","originalBytes":15939,"storedBytes":15939,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["torches","world","ez-tree","mit","havok","camera","game","hotbar","placement","stone","torch","cursor","fog","menu","procedural","rain","slot","via","babylon.js","doors","flower","grass","npm","pause","roads","soldier","textures","water","assets","buildings","day","demo","ground","hold","key","license","light","night","ope